      "surface": "罰",
      "reading": "ばつ",
      "reason": "'罰 (batsu)' is a more general term for 'penalty' or 'punishment' that covers a wider range of contexts (e.g., legal, social, sports, financial) than '刑罰,' which is primarily restricted to criminal punishment. This aligns better with the broad nature of the English lemma 'penalty' for a general learner."
